{"about_the_game":"<br><br><strong>Echoes of Extinction</strong> is an online multiplayer survival game set in a unique prehistoric world. This game blends horror elements with a tribal human civilization, set on an island where dinosaurs and humans compete for supremacy. Players can choose to play as either a human or a dinosaur, each offering a distinct gameplay experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/396fc924cf9d0fb57230ef315922cf97.poster.avif?t=1757413742\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/396fc924cf9d0fb57230ef315922cf97.webm?t=1757413742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/396fc924cf9d0fb57230ef315922cf97.mp4?t=1757413742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Humans in the game must navigate a challenging world, engaging in activities like <u>hunting</u>, <u>crafting</u>, <u>farming</u>, and <u>building</u>. They must also form alliances and strategize in raids for resources. Tribal dynamics add an additional layer of complexity, as players must manage their relationships within their group and with other tribes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/0bcfb77329ec4a28bee24609f6f8c8d6.poster.avif?t=1757413742\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/0bcfb77329ec4a28bee24609f6f8c8d6.webm?t=1757413742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/0bcfb77329ec4a28bee24609f6f8c8d6.mp4?t=1757413742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>On the other side, playing as a dinosaur provides a completely different perspective. Players start as hatchlings, learning to survive in a dangerous world. Each dinosaur species has unique abilities and challenges, including specific <u>dietary needs</u> and <u>environmental adaptations</u>. Dinosaurs must manage their <u>territory</u>, engage in mating rituals, and defend against threats from other dinosaurs and humans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/06944e7527a960bd669f78685896325a.poster.avif?t=1757413742\" width=712 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/06944e7527a960bd669f78685896325a.webm?t=1757413742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/extras/06944e7527a960bd669f78685896325a.mp4?t=1757413742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game's dynamic ecosystem, coupled with changing weather conditions and natural disasters, significantly impacts gameplay and strategy. Players\u2019 decisions have long-lasting effects on the environment and their survival. &quot;Echoes of Extinction&quot; promises a rich, immersive experience, where players can truly shape their journey in this prehistoric landscape.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2822720?t=1757413742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757413742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757413742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757413742","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id"